  {"name":"Aya Kurogane","aliases":[],"role":"Kitsuke's 15-year-old sister; sharp-tongued defender","bio":'''Quick with looks and answers, protects the family by needling it first. Fiercely guards Kitsuke's dignity, threatens war over nicknames, and is the first to suspect that Kei Kashimo is pulling him out of his depth.''',"first_appearance_context":'''At the kitchen table, eyeing Kitsuke over her bowl and demanding he admit if he got in trouble.'''},
  {"name":"Mei Kurogane","aliases":["little sister"],"role":"Kitsuke's 9-year-old sister","bio":'''Talks when nervous, goes quiet when truly upset. Decides Yagami is "the black quiet man who fixes things," asks if thoughts about sweets can be heard, and holds Kitsuke's first ice flower like a star. Her affection makes the compound feel survivable.''',"first_appearance_context":'''At the kitchen table, kicking Kitsuke's shin and asking if Yagami can hear her thinking about sweets.'''},
  {"name":"Hanae Kurogane","aliases":["Mother"],"role":"Kurogane matriarch and clan administrator","bio":'''Polite to everyone, soft only with her children. Runs clan administration with a tight-shouldered public face, negotiates Haruto's authority with practical fear, and chooses arms-first comfort over politics when Kitsuke awakens or vanishes. Keeps a light on after the abduction like a fact.''',"first_appearance_context":'''At the head of the kitchen table, hair pinned up, shoulders tight from a day of clan administration.'''},
