  {"name":"Elder Saito","aliases":[],"role":"Assessment elder; diagnostician of weaves","bio":'''Dry, careful, speaks of abilities like weather reports. Measures Kitsuke's palm with a lens and names his power true-form Cryokinesis, not contamination. Is more honest about unchartable talents like Kenshi Kashimo than about most diagnoses, and tells elders that children are not political weather.''',"first_appearance_context":'''Already waiting in the old assessment room behind the archive wing when Haruto brings Kitsuke in.'''},
  {"name":"Instructor Daisuke","aliases":[],"role":"Junior drill instructor","bio":'''Calls pairs for control tests and keeps the demonstration yard's rules. Recognizes Kitsuke's dominance over Toma and marks Jin's exchange, enforcing "no maiming" while the compound stares.''',"first_appearance_context":'''Calling "Kitsuke Kurogane. Center." during demonstration season.'''},
  {"name":"Toma","aliases":[],"role":"Fifteen-year-old Kurogane neutralization elite","bio":'''Clean, polite, certain; used by instructors to humble loud juniors. His silver neutralization meets Kitsuke's frost in a public bout and he goes to one knee, then bows from there and admits he underestimated the younger boy.''',"first_appearance_context":'''Stepping into the center square for the control test against Kitsuke.'''},
